{"server":"jp","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_ex01_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_ex01","title":"青天霹靂","storyCode":"GT-EX-1","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_ex01_end.txt","sourceHash":"6b4663a7e6e8e066cc132adcb13ae3f828b5389f271c998aafa8c24be1122492","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"古い歌から目覚めたスペクターの目の前に立っていたのは、出発の準備をしているスカジだった。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……我々は彼を麻袋に詰め込み、\n夜明けとともに帆柱に吊るさねばならぬ……。\n……我々は彼の喉を切り裂き、\n暴風雨の中で海にそれを捧げねばならぬ……。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"はっ…！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"……また……この夢……ですか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"あら、誰かしら？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"――あなたですか。でも不思議ですね……どうしてあなたの名前が思い出せないのでしょう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"別に構わないわ。ロドスのオペレーターの一人とでも思ってくれればいい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"苦しそうね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"ウフフ……ただの悪夢ですわ……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"意識の中をぐるぐる廻る黒い破片が、あのボロボロの教会の影の中に隠れて……。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"私が近づくと、それは枷と鎖となり、この私を深い深い海の底へ連れ去っていくのです。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"もう少しでこの苦しみを終わらせる方法が見つかるわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"そうですか。ウフフ……素晴らしいことですが、あなたを信じても良いのでしょうか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"あら。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたの纏うこの空気……私は知っています。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"いえ……違う、これは香り。濃密な香り、血の香り、彼らの香り。深海の香り。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"懐かしくて、嫌な気持ちになる香り。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"そう？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"お名前を……教えていただけますか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"スカジ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたには何故か興味が尽きませんわ……どうやってここへ来たのですか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"ケルシー先生の許可がなければ、この部屋には入れないはず……我を失った私に八つ裂きにされるのを恐れないなら話は別ですが…。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"恐れ……皆恐れているわ。私はそれに慣れているだけ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"そろそろ行く時間ね、戻ってくる頃には状況に進展があるかもしれない。でも、これまで通り私を忘れてくれていいわ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スペクター","speakerId":"char_143_ghost","isRemote":false,"text":"どこへ……向かわれるの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"秘密が眠っているところ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"スカジ","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたからずっとずっと遠くにあるところよ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_143_ghost","aliases":["スペクター"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["？？？","スカジ"]}]}
